{"name":"Trout","hex":"#4c5356","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Trout","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Trout"}],"entries":[{"title":"Trout","blocks":[{"text":"Trout is a generic common name for numerous species of carnivorous freshwater fishes belonging to the genera Oncorhynchus, Salmo, and Salvelinus, all of which are members of the subfamily Salmoninae in the family Salmonidae. The word trout is also used for some similar-shaped but non-salmonid fish, such as the spotted seatrout/speckled trout."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2e/Salmo_trutta.jpg/330px-Salmo_trutta.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trout","wikidata":"Q2258881"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Marble_trout_from_zadla%C5%A1%C4%8Dica.jpg/500px-Marble_trout_from_zadla%C5%A1%C4%8Dica.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Marble_trout_from_zadla%C5%A1%C4%8Dica.jpg/1280px-Marble_trout_from_zadla%C5%A1%C4%8Dica.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Marble_trout_from_zadla%C5%A1%C4%8Dica.jpg/500px-Marble_trout_from_zadla%C5%A1%C4%8Dica.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Salmo: marble trout, S. marmoratus","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMarble_trout_from_zadla%C5%A1%C4%8Dica.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Rainbow_Trout.jpg/500px-Rainbow_Trout.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Rainbow_Trout.jpg/1280px-Rainbow_Trout.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm